/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (Projected estimates using data from FAOSTAT show that pesticide use will increase by 25% over the next 25 years. These estimates suggest by 2050, 100% of agricultural land will be at risk of pesticide based pollution, with almost 50% of agricultural land being at high risk. This has generated an urgent need for more sustainable alternatives to avoid the immeasurable strain on global economies and biodiversity.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
