/T (Our team has designed a 3Dprintable bio-safe insert that clips directly into hive frames, minimising wasted space while maximising access to treatment for both bees and beekeepers. The insert harnesses the natural transfer of RNA within the hive: nurse bees consume the therapeutic patty and deliver its dsRNA payload to developing larvae, where Varroa mites cause the greatest damage to the colony. )
